  "description": "Welcome to the GDTA PYTHON CODE WAR CSE by SNS College of Technology (SNSCT), Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu! A hackathon built around the challenge of Python coding. About the Opportunity: GDTA PYTHON CODE WAR CSE is an online coding challenge presented by SNS College of Technology (SNSCT), Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu. Created for Computer Science and Engineering students, this individual hackathon gives participants the opportunity to solve carefully designed programming problems using Python. Participants will test and strengthen their logical thinking, problem-solving ability, algorithmic skills, and efficient implementation. The challenge encourages accurate, optimized coding and offers a focused way to build confidence in Python programming through a competitive coding experience. Competition Structure: The structure for this online coding challenge is as follows: PYTHON CODE WAR 2026 (GDTA): An online individual coding contest focused on Python programming for Computer Science and Engineering students. Participants will tackle problems ranging from basic programming concepts to algorithmic problem-solving, applying logical thinking and efficient implementation within a limited time. Take the next step with GDTA PYTHON CODE WAR CSE and put your Python problem-solving skills to the test in this online hackathon.",
